function referenceNorm(s){return toSimple(String(s||'')).replace(/衞/g,'卫').replace(/爲/g,'为').replace(/於/g,'于').replace(/羣/g,'群').replace(/餘/g,'余').replace(/[^\p{Script=Han}]/gu,'')}
function referenceProjection(text){let normalized='',positions=[];for(let i=0;i<text.length;i++){const c=referenceNorm(text[i]);if(c){normalized+=c;positions.push(i)}}return {normalized,positions}}
function referenceScore(a,b){if(!a||!b)return 0;if(a===b)return 1;if(a.includes(b)||b.includes(a))return .85*Math.min(a.length,b.length)/Math.max(a.length,b.length)+.15;const grams=s=>new Set(Array.from({length:Math.max(0,s.length-1)},(_,i)=>s.slice(i,i+2))),aa=grams(a),bb=grams(b);let both=0;for(const g of aa)if(bb.has(g))both++;return 2*both/Math.max(1,aa.size+bb.size)}
